Package: git-version-tagger
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: git, libxcb-cursor0, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Suggests: gh
Maintainer: Vitali Shadrin <vital.shadrin2@gmail.com>
Description: Top bar app that moves version tags (3.25-#<hash>) to a branch head
 Replaces the tag.sh script: pick a branch and a version marker from the
 top bar menu and the tag is moved on the remote in one atomic push.
